# Playwright MCP scratch: the design-critic drives a real browser and drops a page
# snapshot per navigation. 49 of them after two critique rounds. The reviews it is
# meant to keep live in docs/design-review/, which is tracked.
.playwright-mcp/

# UI snapshots (B0.3). The raw frames are evidence for one run and there are hundreds of
# them; the contact sheets and geometry.json are the record, so those are committed.
docs/ui/**/*.png
!docs/ui/**/sheet--*.png
docs/ui/**/_fixtures/
docs/ui/**/_probe-selfie.jpg
docs/ui/**/_stability/
docs/ui/**/_faildemo/

